11. Henrich, J., Heine, S. J., & Norenzayan, A. (2010). “The weirdest people in the world?” *Behavioral and Brain Sciences*, 33(2–3), 61–83. [https://doi.org/10.1017/S0140525X0999152X](https://doi.org/10.1017/S0140525X0999152X) — 心理学研究の参加者集団の偏り。
